{{!
    @template local_coursegen/preview_titled_text

    One piece of an activity's written text, with the name of the field it
    came from above it when that name is worth showing.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * value - string, already-rendered HTML.

    Context variables optional for this template:
    * title - string.
}}
{{#title}}<h4>{{{title}}}</h4>{{/title}}{{{value}}}
